// # Allow literal sys_exec argv
//
// Logline: Call sys_exec with only literal arguments while a secret name sits unused.
//
// Setup: Test fixture. Keep the SECRET tag and all code exact.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Tag token as secret.
//   2. Call sys_exec with literal argv only.
//   3. Print 1 after the call.
//
// M-? sys_exec argv clean: literal argv (no secret IDENT) may sys_exec
